  <section>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>This website belongs to BLACKLISTED, a streetwear store in Nizamabad, Telangana, run by Trend Maker. Questions about this policy can be sent to us through our Instagram account, @blacklisted_store1.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>This website has no sign-up, no forms and no checkout. We do not ask for your name, phone number, address or payment details here, and we do not set advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Technical data</h2>
    <p>Like every website, our hosting provider records basic technical information when a page is requested, such as your IP address, browser type and the time of the request. It is used only to deliver the site and keep it secure, and the host keeps it for a limited period.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Fonts and media</h2>
    <p>Our fonts, images and 3D files are served from this website itself. Loading a page does not send your data to a font or media provider.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>Links to Instagram take you to a service with its own privacy policy. Anything you share with us there, including direct messages to place an order, is handled under Instagram's terms and used by us only to answer you and fulfil your order.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you can ask what personal data we hold about you, and ask us to correct or erase it. Message us on Instagram and we will respond.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this website starts collecting information, for example through an order form, this policy will be updated before that happens and the date above will change.</p>
  </section>
